
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Alles ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers

### Eén ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/1

### Aanmaken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUP001",
  "name": "Frank Herbert",
  "address": "Frank Herbert",
  "city": "Amsterdam",
  "zipCode": "1011AA",
  "province": "Noord-Holland",
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactPhone": "123412321",
  "reference": "frank.herbert@example.com"
}

### Aanmaken without a field (name ontbreekt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUP002",
  "address": "Frank Herbert",
  "city": "Amsterdam",
  "zipCode": "1011AA",
  "province": "Noord-Holland",
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactPhone": "123412321",
  "reference": "frank.herbert@example.com"
}

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUP999",
  "name": "Updated Supplier",
  "address": "New Street 10",
  "city": "Rotterdam",
  "zipCode": "3011AA",
  "province": "Zuid-Holland",
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactPhone": "123412321",
  "reference": "Cola"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/1

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/suppliers/999

